#### Shields

| Shield        | Price | AC Bonus* | Speed Penalty | Bulk | Hardness | HP (BT) |
|---------------|-------|-----------|---------------|------|----------|---------|
| Buckler       | 1 gp  | +1        | —             | L    | 3        | 6 (3)   |
| Wooden shield | 1 gp  | +2        | —             | 1    | 3        | 12 (6)  |
| Steel shield  | 2 gp  | +2        | —             | 1    | 5        | 20 (10) |
| Tower shield  | 10 gp | +2/+4*    | –5 ft.        | 4    | 5        | 20 (10) |

. * Gaining a shield's circumstance bonus to AC requires using the Raise a Shield action (found on page 419).
. * Getting the higher bonus for a tower shield requires using the Take Cover action (page 418) while the shield is raised.

